  "note": "From the 12.0.3 -> 13.0.1 IL diff. 13.0.1 gives JsonReader a default MaxDepth of 64 in its constructor, so every reader built by a vulnerable release parses arbitrarily deep nesting. Any Newtonsoft deserialization constructs a JsonReader. An app that sets MaxDepth itself is not affected, and a code scan cannot see that setting.",
